<title>NETHERLANDS: CMG H1 pretax profit rises 31 pct.</title>
<headline>CMG H1 pretax profit rises 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of STERLING unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per shr (pence)	  11.4  vs   8.9</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 11.3  vs   8.6</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (pence)	   2.0  vs   1.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     116.6  vs  94.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.2  vs   8.6</p>
<p>    Profit after tax		     7.1  vs   5.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Interim dividend payable on November 20. Ex-dividend date is October 7. CMG (Computer Management Group) is a computer services company listed on the Amsterdam and London bourses.</p>
</text>
